latform, is now live. It's fast, easy to use, and deeply integrated with Cursor.\",\n        \"source\": \"X\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Grok 4.6 is now available in GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"description\": \"xAI's Grok 4.6 model landed in GitHub Copilot's model picker across surfaces including VS Code, Visual Studio, Copilot CLI, and the cloud agent, priced at $2/M input and $6/M output tokens.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog/label/copilot/\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-14\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Auto mode becomes the default permission mode for new sessions on Pro, Max, and Team plans\",\n    \"description\": \"Starting August 14, 2026, Claude Code's 'auto mode' became the default permission mode for new sessions on Pro, Max, and Team plans unless users have set their own default mode. Auto mode uses a classifier to review Bash commands instead of prompting for every action; explicit permission rules still fire before the classifier.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new/2026-w32\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-14\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"If you're relying on a prompt to constrain agent behavior, you've already lost.\",\n        \"source\": \"HN\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"it's a good default because you really do get prompted incessantly without it.\",\n        \"source\": \"HN\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Auto mode has been a total game-changer and become core to how I work with Claude.\",\n        \"source\": \"X\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Cloud Agents st